  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0017","literal","As to all who resell private salt for consumption: fifty-seven strokes of the bamboo; the confiscation statute does not apply.","As to all who purchase private salt for consumption: fifty-seven strokes of the bamboo; the confiscation statute does not apply.","s0017 轉買私鹽食用者 means buyers of illicit salt for eating; 轉買 is purchase, not resale, and the idiomatic already has buy.","high","applied"],
    ["s0108","idiomatic","Brothers who in a quarrel jointly beat their fathers to death are all executed.","Brothers who in a quarrel jointly beat their paternal uncles to death are all executed.","In this kinship-homicide cluster, 諸父 are paternal uncles, aligning with nearby 伯叔母 and 從父; 'fathers' misreads the victim class.","high","applied"],
    ["s0108","literal","As to all brothers who in a quarrel jointly plot to beat to death their fathers: all are executed.","As to all brothers who in a quarrel jointly plot to beat to death their paternal uncles: all are executed.","Same statute: 諸父 denotes paternal uncles, not fathers; the literal must match that kinship sense.","high","applied"],
    ["s0195","idiomatic","If a man kills his wife's husband through adultery without the adulteress's knowledge, the penalty is reduced from death.","If through adultery a man kills the woman's lawful husband without the adulteress's knowledge, the penalty is reduced from death.","本夫 is the adulteress's lawful husband; 'his wife's husband' invents a nonsensical victim and misidentifies 本夫.","high","applied"],
    ["s0195","literal","As to all who through adultery kill their own husband while the adulteress did not know: sentence with death reduced.","As to all who through adultery kill her lawful husband while the adulteress did not know: sentence with death reduced.","The silent agent is the adulterer killing 本夫; 'their own husband' wrongly makes the victim the killer's husband.","high","applied"],
    ["s0204","idiomatic","Those who demand adultery and, when refused, beat their wife to death are sentenced as armed robbers who kill.","Those who demand adultery and, when refused, beat the woman to death are sentenced as armed robbers who kill.","求奸不從…毆死其婦 refers to beating the woman who refused the advance; 其婦 is not the offender's wife.","high","applied"],
    ["s0204","literal","As to all who seek adultery and, when refused, beat their wife to death: sentenced as for an armed robber who kills.","As to all who seek adultery and, when refused, beat the woman to death: sentenced as for an armed robber who kills.","Same clause: 其婦 is the woman sought for illicit sex, so 'wife' over-specifies and misleads.","high","applied"],
    ["s0232","idiomatic","up to twenty guan, the ringleader is executed and the rest exiled afar.","when the loot reaches twenty guan, the ringleader is executed and the rest exiled afar.","至二十貫 is the threshold at which the ringleader dies after the prior 'any loot' step; 'up to' reverses the scale.","high","applied"],
    ["s0240","idiomatic","up to twenty guan: seventy-seven strokes.","when the loot reaches twenty guan: seventy-seven strokes.","In the graded theft scale after 十貫以下, 至二十貫 marks the next threshold, not an upper bound.","high","applied"],
    ["s0416","idiomatic","Sons, younger brothers, or sons-in-law who steal and surrender a father's, elder brother's, or father-in-law's head are exempt as if they had surrendered voluntarily.","When a son steals and his father reports him, when a younger brother steals and his elder brother reports him, or when a son-in-law steals and his father-in-law reports him, all are exempt as if they had surrendered voluntarily.","父首/兄首/翁首 means the senior relative reports (出首) the thief; 首 is not 'head', and nearby 不首/自首 confirm the reporting sense.","high","applied"],
    ["s0416","literal","As to all sons who steal and surrender their fathers' heads, younger brothers who steal and surrender elder brothers' heads, and sons-in-law who steal and surrender fathers-in-law's heads: all are exempt like voluntary surrenderants.","As to all cases where a son steals and the father reports him, a younger brother steals and the elder brother reports him, or a son-in-law steals and the father-in-law reports him: all are exempt like voluntary surrenderants.","Literal 'surrender … heads' mistranslates 首; the statute treats senior kin reporting the junior thief like voluntary surrender.","high","applied"],
    ["s0417","idiomatic","Slaves who steal and surrender their master's head are sentenced without tattoo or double restitution and remain their master's slaves.","When a slave steals and the master reports him, the slave is sentenced without tattoo or double restitution and remains the master's slave.","Parallel to s0416: 奴盜主首 is a slave's theft reported by the master, not surrender of a severed head.","high","applied"],
    ["s0417","literal","As to all slaves who steal and surrender their master's head: sentenced, exempt from tattoo, no double restitution, still returned to the master as slaves.","As to all slaves who steal and whose master reports them: sentenced, exempt from tattoo, no double restitution, still returned to the master as slaves.","Same 首 = report reading: the master reports the slave thief; 'master's head' is unsupported.","high","applied"]
  ],
